From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 6 Aug 2026 19:28:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 13/28] Add Telegram notifier: per-step stats and freeze
 call-out

Per step: step time, loss, entropy, grad norm, running mean reward, last 5
rewards. On freeze: Telegram message plus a CallMeBot phone call.

Freeze requires BOTH the trainer step counter and the orchestrator batch
counter to be static for FREEZE_MIN minutes. A slow batch alone is normal and
must not page anyone -- batches have legitimately taken 30+ min tonight.

Credentials come from the environment (TG_BOT_TOKEN, TG_CHAT_ID,
CALLMEBOT_KEY) so nothing secret enters git.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017wiESxhziDrnsLnG9aizTd
